  "body": "If you’re looking for your first home or investment, this brand-new three-bedroom home in Orewa is an easy one to consider. Set on one level and facing the reserve, it offers a comfortable layout and low-maintenance living in a convenient location.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen, dining and living areas are open plan, creating a relaxed space for everyday living. There’s also easy access to outside, perfect for enjoying a morning coffee, relaxing after work or spending time with family and friends.\r\n\r\nThere are three well-sized bedrooms, including a master with its own ensuite and access outdoors. The other two bedrooms share the family bathroom, while an internal-access single garage and an extra off-street parking space add to the everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nThe location is another plus. Strathmill is a growing community with convenient motorway access, while Orewa Beach, cafés, schools and shops are all just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nHow to find Awa Uru Road:\r\nFollow West Hoe Heights until you see the Strathmill sign. Turn left onto Awa Uru Road and follow the signs.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
